Subject: [PATCH] Carry One UI 9 public type splits into the original r9s API30 mapping

SM-G990E_THL already maps persist_debug_prop to
system_user_mode_emulation_prop and vendor_file to vendor_boot_ota_file.
It also already includes sysfs_mem_sleep and sysfs_udc in sysfs_30_0.
Preserve those entries and all five additional r9s type declarations;
add only the remaining reviewed One UI 9 public type splits.

diff --git a/mapping/30.0.cil b/mapping/30.0.cil
--- a/mapping/30.0.cil
